<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/ieee-1484-11-2-2020-ecmascript-runtime-api> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An IEEE standard defining an ECMAScript application programming interface for communication between learning content and a runtime service, typically supplied by a Learning Management System. It standardizes common API services used to exchange runtime learning data." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/ieee-1484-11-2-2020-ecmascript-runtime-api/versions/1> .
